<section class="opensource-section">
	<div class="section-container">

		<header class="section-header">
			<h2 class="section-title">Open Source</h2>
			<p class="section-subtitle">開源貢獻 — 程式碼禮物</p>
		</header>

		<div class="projects-list">

			<a href="https://github.com/daviddaytw/react-native-transformers" target="_blank" class="project-item" data-simple-event="opensource_react_native_transformers">
				<div class="project-fill"></div>
				<div class="project-inner">
					<div class="project-index">01</div>
					<div class="project-body">
						<div class="project-title-row">
							<h3 class="project-name">react-native-transformers</h3>
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
								<path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<p class="project-description">
							想在手機 App 裡跑 AI 模型？這個工具讓 Huggingface 的大語言模型能在 React Native 中飛奔！因為誰說 AI 只能活在雲端？
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</a>

			<a href="https://github.com/daviddaytw/ally-casdoor" target="_blank" class="project-item" data-simple-event="opensource_ally_casdoor">
				<div class="project-fill"></div>
				<div class="project-inner">
					<div class="project-index">02</div>
					<div class="project-body">
						<div class="project-title-row">
							<h3 class="project-name">ally-casdoor</h3>
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
								<path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<p class="project-description">
							讓 AdonisJS 和 Casdoor 成為好朋友的橋樑！OAuth2 登入從此不再是惡夢，而是一場優雅的舞蹈。
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</a>

			<a href="https://github.com/daviddaytw/davidday.tw/blob/2ed86bd662fcc99fa7cbff400b2cda1c0f368d7d/posts/media-bias/index.ipynb" target="_blank" class="project-item" data-simple-event="opensource_media_bias">
				<div class="project-fill"></div>
				<div class="project-inner">
					<div class="project-index">03</div>
					<div class="project-body">
						<div class="project-title-row">
							<h3 class="project-name">量化評估臺灣新聞媒體偏見</h3>
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
								<path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<p class="project-description">
							用數據說話，看看台灣媒體到底有多偏？這不是政治立場，而是科學分析！
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</a>

		</div>

	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.opensource-section {
		background: #000;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.section-container {
		max-width: 1400px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 4rem 4rem;
	}

	.section-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 2rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
		font-weight: 200;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		line-height: 0.9;
		margin: 0;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.section-subtitle {
		font-size: clamp(0.875rem, 1.5vw, 1rem);
		font-weight: 300;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		margin: 0;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.projects-list {
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
	}

	.project-item {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		display: block;
		text-decoration: none;
		color: #fff;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
		transition: color 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.77, 0, 0.175, 1);
	}

	.project-fill {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: #fff;
		clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0);
		transition: clip-path 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.77, 0, 0.175, 1);
		z-index: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.project-item:hover .project-fill { clip-path: inset(0 0% 0 0); }
	.project-item:hover { color: #000; }

	.project-inner {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 1.75rem 0;
	}

	.project-index {
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		font-weight: 200;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
		transition: color 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.77, 0, 0.175, 1);
		text-align: right;
	}

	.project-item:hover .project-index { color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12); }

	.project-body {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.project-title-row {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.project-name {
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.875rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		margin: 0;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		line-height: 1.1;
	}

	.project-title-row svg {
		width: 22px;
		height: 22px;
		flex-shrink: 0;
		opacity: 0.3;
		transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
	}

	.project-item:hover .project-title-row svg {
		opacity: 0.6;
		transform: translate(3px, -3px);
	}

	.project-description {
		font-size: clamp(0.9375rem, 1.5vw, 1.0625rem);
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
		margin: 0;
		transition: color 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.77, 0, 0.175, 1);
		max-width: 68ch;
	}

	.project-item:hover .project-description { color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); }

	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.section-container { padding: 2.5rem 3rem 3rem; }
		.project-inner { grid-template-columns: 5rem 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.section-container { padding: 2rem 1.5rem 3rem; }
		.project-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.5rem 0; }
		.project-index { font-size: 1.5rem; text-align: left; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); }
		.project-item:hover .project-index { color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); }
	}
</style>
